<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Prince Rupert's Drop — Bullet Impact vs. Tail Snip</title>
<style>
*, *::before, *::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
